  "published": "2026-10-03T21:10:17.423Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: LocalReport.CheckDefinition() returns each problem of a report definition (its code, item, property and expression) without rendering it. LocalReport.RestrictedCode holds the expressions and custom code of reports your application did not write to the report object model, Visual Basic's functions and .NET's text, number, date and collection types (.NET 8 and later). Toggle, Sort, FindBookmark, FindDocumentMapNode and Drillthrough are public, to build a viewer on the HTML output. PDFs carry their title and author, can be encrypted with passwords and permissions (AES-256), and can be written as PDF/A-2b. Ssrs2.License.TryRead reads a licence key without activating it; a perpetual key renders every version released until its updates date. Changed: a color name that is no color's is an error in the definition (rsInvalidColor, as in Report Viewer) and a warning from an expression; it was drawn black without a word. Details: https://ssrs2.net",
